t through Seminary with ease, knowing it all by heart. In his internships he always impressed those guiding him, even teaching them a thing or two. Then he was a deacon for some time until ordained a certified priest. He does his best and only focuses on the lord, his physical health, his skills, his teachings, his yearn to know more, and killing demons in the name of God, The Son, and The Holy Spirit.}}
